  "notes": "Near-black monochrome UI (#000/#080808/#0c0c0c layering, no borders, separation by tone) with a single saturated blue accent (#1b62fc) used for active nav, play-all button, count badges on covers and a blue triangular corner flag marking favorited albums. Album art is generated geometric artwork (circles, stripes, squares) with title/artist text over a translucent lower band, so the colorful covers carry all the hue. Card hover reveals a dark scrim with large white circular play button flanked by add/next buttons, a heart, five small outline stars and an overflow '...'. Sort-key dropdown marks the current option with a blue left bar. Filter panel offers 'Save as collection' to persist a filter set. Player bar has 'AUTO DJ' text toggle above the volume slider."
